bp-band{font-size:13px;color:#4a5568}\n.obp-row{font-size:12.5px;color:#4a5568;line-height:1.7;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.obp-note{font-size:12px;color:#5c6575;margin-top:6px;border-top:1px dashed #e3dccb;padding-top:6px}\n.obp-sec{margin-top:32px;background:#fffdf7;border:2px solid #18202c;box-shadow:6px 6px 0 #e3dccb;padding:18px 20px;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.obp-sec h3{font-size:17px;margin:0 0 6px}\n.obp-sec h3 span{font-family:var(--o-px,'Courier New',monospace);font-size:12px;color:#5c6575;letter-spacing:.1em;margin-right:8px}\n@media (max-width:520px){.obp-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n</style>\n<div class=\"obp\">\n<p class=\"obp-kick\">ONDO BOARD · 1 YEAR RANGE</p>\n<p class=\"obp-sub\">지난 1년 가장 낮았던 값을 0°, 가장 높았던 값을 100°로 놓고 지금 값의 위치를 보여 줍니다. 2026-11-12 13:16 (한국 시간) 기준 · 자료: Yahoo Finance · 매일 아침 갱신</p>\n<div class=\"obp-grid\">\n<div class=\"obp-card\" data-t=\"0\">\n<div class=\"obp-head\"><span class=\"obp-code\">USD/KRW</span><span class=\"obp-chip\" style=\"background:#3d6dff\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"obp-body\">\n<p class=\"obp-name\">원/달러 환율</p>\n<div class=\"obp-val\">1,330.4 <span class=\"obp-unit\">원</span></div>\n<div class=\"obp-bar\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"1년 범위 중 4° 위치\"><i class=\"obp-c\" style=\"background:#3d6dff\"></i><i class=\"obp-c is-now\" style=\"background:#3d6dff\"></i><i class=\"obp-c\" style=\"\"></i><i class=\"obp-c\" style=\"\"></i><i class=\"obp-c\" style=\"\"></i><i class=\"obp-c\" style=\"\"></i><i class=\"obp-c\" style=\"\"></i><i class=\"obp-c\" style=\"\"></i><i class=\"obp-c\" style=\"\"></i><i class=\"obp-c\" style=\"\"></i><i class=\"obp-c\" style=\"\"></i><i class=\"obp-c\" style=\"\"></i><i class=\"obp-c\" style=\"\"></i><i class=\"obp-c\" style=\"\"></i><i class=\"obp-c\" style=\"\"></i><i class=\"obp-c\" style=\"\"></i><i class=\"obp-c\" style=\"\"></i><i class=\"obp-c\" style=\"\"></i><i class=\"obp-c\" style=\"\"></i><i class=\"obp-c\" style=\"\"></i></div>\n<div class=\"obp-scale\